{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_locke": {
        "attack": "【附加包】<#ff9028ff>圣银穿心<>：攻击附带<#a974ffff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>15%<>魔法伤害，外加目标已损失生命8%。<#ff9028ff>灵焰仪式<>：灰猎无影落到敌方英雄身边时点燃（每<#ffb900ff>16秒<>一次）：<#ffb900ff>4秒<>内攻速+35%、移速+40%（递减），<#ffb900ff>每秒<>受到当前生命2%<#f5f5f5ff>真实伤害<>，结束时回复其中70%。",
        "ult": "【附加包】法器箱砸向敌方英雄：周围敌人受到<#a974ffff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<>魔法伤害并<#ef5350ff>减速<>50%（递减）；英雄被标记<#ffb900ff>4秒<>，生命低于最大生命15%即被<#f5f5f5ff>处决<>，倒下处留下法器，捡起得一层封印（最多3层，整局保留）：处决线+3%，大招剩余冷却-50%。",
        "skill": "【附加包】接连掷出三枚咒钉，每枚造成<#a974ffff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>20%<>魔法伤害并<#ef5350ff>减速<>15%<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>（可叠加）。钉中英雄后<#ffb900ff>4秒<>内，他的攻击引爆钉子：每枚<#a974ffff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>12%<>魔法伤害，两枚+25%，三枚+50%。",
        "skill2": "【附加包】瞬移到敌方英雄身边，对周围敌人造成<#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>25%<>魔法伤害；<#ffb900ff>3秒<>内下一次攻击冲穿目标，造成<#a974ffff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<>魔法伤害。被他打过的英雄<#ffb900ff>3秒<>内阵亡时冷却刷新。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_locke": {
        "attack": "【附加包】<#ff9028ff>銀樁咒殺<>：攻擊附帶<#a974ffff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>15%<>魔法傷害，外加目標已損失生命8%。<#ff9028ff>燃魂回元<>：瞬影追命落到敵方英雄身邊時點燃（每<#ffb900ff>16秒<>一次）：<#ffb900ff>4秒<>內攻速+35%、移速+40%（遞減），<#ffb900ff>每秒<>受到當前生命2%<#f5f5f5ff>真實傷害<>，結束時回復其中70%。",
        "ult": "【附加包】法器箱砸向敵方英雄：周圍敵人受到<#a974ffff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<>魔法傷害並<#ef5350ff>緩速<>50%（遞減）；英雄被標記<#ffb900ff>4秒<>，生命低於最大生命15%即被<#f5f5f5ff>處決<>，倒下處留下法器，撿起得一層封印（最多3層，整局保留）：處決線+3%，大招剩餘冷卻-50%。",
        "skill": "【附加包】接連擲出三枚咒釘，每枚造成<#a974ffff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>20%<>魔法傷害並<#ef5350ff>緩速<>15%<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>（可疊加）。釘中英雄後<#ffb900ff>4秒<>內，他的攻擊引爆咒釘：每枚<#a974ffff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>12%<>魔法傷害，兩枚+25%，三枚+50%。",
        "skill2": "【附加包】瞬移到敵方英雄身邊，對周圍敵人造成<#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>25%<>魔法傷害；<#ffb900ff>3秒<>內下一次攻擊衝穿目標，造成<#a974ffff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<>魔法傷害。被他打過的英雄<#ffb900ff>3秒<>內陣亡時冷卻重置。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_locke": {
        "attack": "[Add-on] <#ff9028ff>Silver Stake<>: attacks deal <#a974ffff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>15%<> bonus magic damage + 8% of the target's missing health. <#ff9028ff>Soul Ignition<>: landing Ashen Pursuit by an enemy champion ignites him (<#ffb900ff>16s<> cooldown): <#ffb900ff>4s<> of +35% attack speed and +40% decaying move speed; he takes 2% current health as <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<> <#ffb900ff>each second<>, then heals 70% of it.",
        "ult": "[Add-on] Hurls his case at an enemy champion: <#a974ffff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<> magic damage around it and a 50% decaying <#ef5350ff>slow<>; champions there are marked for <#ffb900ff>4s<> and <#f5f5f5ff>executed<> below 15% max health, leaving the artifact where they fall. Picking it up grants a seal (up to 3, kept all game): the line +3%, the ult's remaining cooldown -50%.",
        "skill": "[Add-on] Throws three nails in a row, each dealing <#a974ffff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>20%<> magic damage and <#ef5350ff>slowing<> 15% for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<> (stacking). For <#ffb900ff>4s<> after nailing a champion, his attack pops the nails: <#a974ffff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>12%<> magic damage each, +25% for two, +50% for three.",
        "skill2": "[Add-on] Blinks next to an enemy champion, dealing <#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>25%<> magic damage around him; his next attack within <#ffb900ff>3s<> dashes through the target for <#a974ffff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<> magic damage. Resets when a champion he hit dies within <#ffb900ff>3s<>."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_locke": {
        "attack": "[확장] <#ff9028ff>은빛 말뚝<>: 공격 시 <#a974ffff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>15%<> 추가 마법 피해 + 대상이 잃은 체력의 8%. <#ff9028ff>영혼 점화<>: 잿빛 추격이 적 챔피언 곁에 착지하면 발동(<#ffb900ff>16초<>마다): <#ffb900ff>4초<> 동안 공격 속도 +35%, 이동 속도 +40%(점차 감소), <#ffb900ff>매초<> 현재 체력 2% <#f5f5f5ff>고정 피해<>, 끝나면 잃은 만큼의 70% 회복.",
        "ult": "[확장] 법구 상자를 적 챔피언에게 던짐: 주변 적에게 <#a974ffff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<> 마법 피해, 50% <#ef5350ff>둔화<>(점차 감소); 챔피언은 <#ffb900ff>4초<> 동안 표식, 체력이 최대 체력의 15% 미만이면 <#f5f5f5ff>처형<>하고 그 자리에 법구를 남김. 주우면 봉인 1개(최대 3개, 게임 내내 유지): 처형선 +3%, 궁극기 남은 대기시간 -50%.",
        "skill": "[확장] 대못 세 개를 연달아 던져 각각 <#a974ffff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>20%<> 마법 피해, <#ffb900ff>1.5초<> 동안 15% <#ef5350ff>둔화<>(중첩). 챔피언을 맞히면 <#ffb900ff>4초<> 안에 그의 공격이 대못을 터뜨림: 개당 <#a974ffff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>12%<> 마법 피해, 두 개 +25%, 세 개 +50%.",
        "skill2": "[확장] 적 챔피언 곁으로 순간이동해 주변 적에게 <#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>25%<> 마법 피해; <#ffb900ff>3초<> 안의 다음 공격은 대상을 꿰뚫고 돌진해 <#a974ffff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<> 마법 피해. 그가 때린 챔피언이 <#ffb900ff>3초<> 안에 죽으면 재사용 대기시간 초기화."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_locke": {
        "attack": "【拡張】<#ff9028ff>シルバー・ステイク<>：攻撃に<#a974ffff>15<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>15%<>＋対象の減少体力8%の魔法ダメージ。<#ff9028ff>ソウル・イグニッション<>：灰塵の追撃で敵チャンピオンの側に着地で発動（<#ffb900ff>16秒<>毎）：<#ffb900ff>4秒<>間攻撃速度+35%、移動速度最大+40%、<#ffb900ff>毎秒<>現在体力2%の<#f5f5f5ff>確定ダメージ<>、終了時にその70%回復。",
        "ult": "【拡張】ケースを敵チャンピオンに投げつけ、周囲の敵に<#a974ffff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>80%<>の魔法ダメージと50%<#ef5350ff>スロウ<>（減衰）；チャンピオンに<#ffb900ff>4秒<>の印、体力が最大体力の15%未満なら<#f5f5f5ff>処刑<>し聖具を残す。拾うと封印1つ（最大3、ずっと残る）：処刑ライン+3%、アルティメットの残りCD-50%。",
        "skill": "【拡張】釘を3本続けて投げ、それぞれ<#a974ffff>35<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>20%<>の魔法ダメージと<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>15%<#ef5350ff>スロウ<>（重複）。チャンピオンに刺さると<#ffb900ff>4秒<>以内の攻撃で釘が炸裂：1本<#a974ffff>25<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>12%<>の魔法ダメージ、2本+25%、3本+50%。",
        "skill2": "【拡張】敵チャンピオンの側へ瞬間移動し周囲の敵に<#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>25%<>の魔法ダメージ；<#ffb900ff>3秒<>以内の次の攻撃は対象を突き抜けて<#a974ffff>55<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<>の魔法ダメージ。攻撃したチャンピオンが<#ffb900ff>3秒<>以内に倒れるとクールダウン解消。"
      }
    }
  }
}
